msgstr ""
"`TLK_REGISTER_BEFORE_SLEEP(fn, level, priority)` → 段 `.before_sleep_array_<level>_<priority>`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:83
msgid ""
"`TLK_REGISTER_AFTER_SLEEP(fn, level, priority)` → section "
"`.after_sleep_array_<level>_<priority>`"
msgstr ""
"`TLK_REGISTER_AFTER_SLEEP(fn, level, priority)` → 段 `.after_sleep_array_<level>_<priority>`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:85
msgid "`void tlk_before_sleep(void)`"
msgstr "`void tlk_before_sleep(void)`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:86
msgid "`void tlk_after_sleep(void)`"
msgstr "`void tlk_after_sleep(void)`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:96
msgid "Prevent-suspend / prevent-sleep callbacks"
msgstr "阻止挂起/阻止睡眠回调"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:99
msgid "`typedef bool (*tlk_prevent_suspend_func_t)(void)`"
msgstr "`typedef bool (*tlk_prevent_suspend_func_t)(void)`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:100
msgid "`typedef bool (*tlk_prevent_sleep_func_t)(void)`"
msgstr "`typedef bool (*tlk_prevent_sleep_func_t)(void)`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:102
msgid "`TLK_REGISTER_PREVENT_SUSPEND(fn)` → section `.prevent_suspend_array`"
msgstr "`TLK_REGISTER_PREVENT_SUSPEND(fn)` → 段 `.prevent_suspend_array`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:103
msgid "`TLK_REGISTER_PREVENT_SLEEP(fn)` → section `.prevent_sleep_array`"
msgstr "`TLK_REGISTER_PREVENT_SLEEP(fn)` → 段 `.prevent_sleep_array`"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:104
msgid "**Invokers and semantics:**"
msgstr "**调用器与语义：**"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:105
msgid ""
"`bool tlk_prevent_suspend(void)` — returns `true` as soon as any "
"registered `tlk_prevent_suspend_func_t` returns `true`; otherwise returns"
" `false`."
msgstr ""
"`bool tlk_prevent_suspend(void)` — 当任何已注册的 `tlk_prevent_suspend_func_t` 返回 `true` 时立即返回 `true`；否则返回 `false`。"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:106
msgid ""
"`bool tlk_prevent_sleep(void)` — returns `true` as soon as any registered"
" `tlk_prevent_sleep_func_t` returns `true`; otherwise returns `false`."
msgstr ""
"`bool tlk_prevent_sleep(void)` — 当任何已注册的 `tlk_prevent_sleep_func_t` 返回 `true` 时立即返回 `true`；否则返回 `false`。"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:118
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "补充说明"

#: ../../source/developing/init_hooks.md:120
msgid ""
"The functions provided by this API **should not** be invoked by the user."
" They are called automatically on the corresponding lifecycle stages."
msgstr ""
"此 API 提供的函数**不应**由用户调用。它们会在相应的生命周期阶段被自动调用。"
